      "text": "This is an answer written by a candidate who achieved a Band 6.5 score.\n"
    },
    {
      "box": [
        70.98046875,
        132.47506713867188,
        494.6390075683594,
        146.55441284179688
      ],
      "text": "It is said that taking risks brings a lot of benefits. However, it also gives us some drawbacks.\n"
    },
    {
      "box": [
        70.65337371826172,
        154.71780395507812,
        527.0347290039062,
        168.46966552734375
      ],
      "text": "First of all, it is obvious that taking risks will cause a great loss if people do it and fail. In personal\n"
    },
    {
      "box": [
        70.32627868652344,
        170.74563598632812,
        504.38665771484375,
        217.20779418945312
      ],
      "text": "life, this loss might not be so harmful. However, it will be really harmful in professional life,\nbecause people take a responsibility not only for themselves but also others such as colleages,\ncustomers and their families. It will even damage the society from the economic point.\n"
    },
    {
      "box": [
        70.32633972167969,
        225.04403686523438,
        511.2311706542969,
        287.5340270996094
      ],
      "text": "On the other hand, we can receive huge benefits by taking risks. Firstly, we can learn how to\nprepare for one goal through this process. In order to achieve the aim, people will make all the\nefforts to think about it and try to find more efficient way. If they do this in the professional\ncircumstances, they will recognise the responsibility and importance of cooperation.\n"
    },
    {
      "box": [
        69.34504699707031,
        296.0245056152344,
        531.0974731445312,
        326.4588317871094
      ],
      "text": "Also, it will be completely meaningful even though people can't achieve the goal after taking risks.\nThey will learn the reason why they have failed and how to change it. The failure will enable them to\n"
    },
    {
      "box": [
        70.98052978515625,
        328.08026123046875,
        333.5101318359375,
        341.50469970703125
      ],
      "text": "improve their skills and to achieve their object next time.\n"
    },
    {
      "box": [
        69.9992446899414,
        350.65008544921875,
        533.0927734375,
        396.78509521484375
      ],
      "text": "As | mentioned, it is true that taking risks give us both advantages and disadvantages. However, it\ncan be argued that the benefits outweighed the drawbacks in that we can obtain advantages not only\nfrom the result but also from the process of taking risks.\n"
    },
